---
// NOT prerendered: nav needs request-time auth state.
import '../styles/globals.css';
import Navigation from '../components/navigation';
import Footer from '../components/footer';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;0,6..72,600;1,6..72,400;1,6..72,500;1,6..72,600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <title>Terms of Service — Aspire Sports</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Aspire Sports terms of service." />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-cream text-ink antialiased">
    <Navigation client:load />

    <main id="main-content" class="flex-1 pt-24 pb-16 px-4">
      <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-ink">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-ink mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-ink-muted mb-8">Last updated: April 2026</p>

        <section class="space-y-4 text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            These terms govern your use of the Aspire Sports website, registration platform, and
            related services. By creating an account or registering a child for a program, you agree
            to these terms on behalf of yourself and the participant.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-ink mt-8">Accounts</h2>
          <p>
            You are responsible for keeping your account credentials confidential and for all
            activity under your account. Accounts are for parents or legal guardians; participants
            under 13 may not create their own accounts.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-ink mt-8">Program registration</h2>
          <p>
            Registration is complete only when payment or a deposit is received. Aspire Sports
            reserves the right to decline, cancel, or modify registrations (including moving a
            participant between age groups or teams) for safety, fairness, or operational reasons.
            Waivers signed during registration are part of these terms.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-ink mt-8">Payments and refunds</h2>
          <p>
            Payments are processed by our payment provider; Aspire Sports does not store full
            payment-card details. Refunds follow the <a class="text-primary" href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a>.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-ink mt-8">Conduct</h2>
          <p>
            Participants, parents, and spectators agree to follow the Aspire Code of Conduct
            (sportsmanship, respect for coaches and officials, no harassment). Violations may result
            in removal from a program without refund.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-ink mt-8">Media</h2>
          <p>
            We occasionally photograph or record games and practices for program coverage. The
            registration waiver covers your consent preferences; you can opt out at any time by
            emailing us.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-ink mt-8">Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p>
            Participation in sports involves inherent risk. The registration waiver releases Aspire
            Sports, its coaches, volunteers, and facilities from claims arising from participation,
            except where prohibited by law.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-ink mt-8">Changes</h2>
          <p>
            We may update these terms. Material changes will be announced on this page with a new
            "last updated" date. Continued use after changes means you accept the updated terms.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-ink mt-8">Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions? Email <a class="text-primary" href="mailto:info@aspiresports.com">info@aspiresports.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </main>

    <Footer client:idle />
  </body>
</html>
